=200&s=534ad77944f1b46a06478ba47c50413d 3x"}, "body": "Hello, 小田さん!\nThank you for the previous illustration! I really love your expressive color work and how you depict the character's eye!\n\nThis time, I would like to request an illustration of my character, Borealis.\n\nBorealis is a quiet and docile boy who often dresses like a female. He has a pair of eyes that resemble aurora-colored jewels. \n\nHe is the guardian deity of a country that became ruined after a war. Despite being the only living being left in the country, he takes his job quite seriously and works non-stop to attempt to purify the land that is now filled with hateful spirits and residual thoughts left by people who past away due to the war.\n\nPlease feel free to draw him in any expression and pose.\nThank you for your consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/11OhdrMoTo8_iCWGlXfJLDJja8Gdmg6OA?usp=sharing", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@oda_koden/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1700697, "client_id": 2244237, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4461c3a7/uploads/origins/b82f11e5-73a7-472f-bf08-0cc7b61c62d3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=01973d4517d614e2d72c3edf3ff7a5b1", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4461c3a7/uploads/origins/b82f11e5-73a7-472f-bf08-0cc7b61c62d3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=01973d4517d614e2d72c3edf3ff7a5b1, https://si.imgix.net/4461c3a7/uploads/origins/b82f11e5-73a7-472f-bf08-0cc7b61c62d3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2ae61846129234c4a73331d66aab874b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4461c3a7/uploads/origins/b82f11e5-73a7-472f-bf08-0cc7b61c62d3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3acf3dcf15ecc710d076381b9df6986d 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4461c3a7/uploads/origins/b82f11e5-73a7-472f-bf08-0cc7b61c62d3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e87e3c7eb630a3cf9e15b065092a0267", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4461c3a7/uploads/origins/b82f11e5-73a7-472f-bf08-0cc7b61c62d3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e87e3c7eb630a3cf9e15b065092a0267, https://si.imgix.net/4461c3a7/uploads/origins/b82f11e5-73a7-472f-bf08-0cc7b61c62d3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=10018b7e80478041ff6ac647094f8076 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4461c3a7/uploads/origins/b82f11e5-73a7-472f-bf08-0cc7b61c62d3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=610c1c5341714c33917308b8dc8d651a 3x"}, "body": "小田さん、こんにちは。小田さんと一緒に仕事をするのが大好きで、私の新しいVTuberモデルをぜひ描いてほしいです\n\nもしよろしければ、私のTwitter/Twitch/YouTubeであなたの作品を紹介したいので、作品を16:9にしていただけませんか？\n\n舌ピアスを取り入れて、シリアスな作品にしていただけると嬉しいです。いつも信頼していますよ〜💞。\n\n小田さん、ありがとうございました\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-FSg794-YLQhuqstzPY4zRc-AuBp1uSs", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@oda_koden/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1700697, "client_id": 73667, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4170b3b3/uploads/origins/c2bc9de3-8cd6-4df1-a8b0-ab8227e7c38d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5917db96bb3c3a3bc7699b95fb0f419c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4170b3b3/uploads/origins/c2bc9de3-8cd6-4df1-a8b0-ab8227e7c38d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5917db96bb3c3a3bc7699b95fb0f419c, https://si.imgix.net/4170b3b3/uploads/origins/c2bc9de3-8cd6-4df1-a8b0-ab8227e7c38d?bg=